<title>CANADA: Uniforet sets US$125 mln note offering.</title>
<headline>Uniforet sets US$125 mln note offering.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uniforet Inc said on Monday that its board of directors approved a US$125 million offering of 11-1/8 percent senior secured notes due 2006.</p>
<p>Uniforet said in a statement that the notes will be sold in the United States by way of a private placement.</p>
<p>The proceeds will be used for working capital, to repay some debt, and to finance a capital expenditure program at its Port-Cartier pulp mill and sawmill.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
